{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CgeZ9U4d1GpYa65MSVHtv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Pitch for Lead Gen SaaS Founders\n\n**Extract qualified leads from unstructured data at scale—no parsing pipelines required.**\n\nInstructor PHP transforms messy prospect data (emails, forms, web scrapes, social profiles) into validated, typed lead objects instantly. Instead of building custom parsers and validation layers, route raw inputs through LLMs with schema enforcement—get structured CRM records back.\n\n**Problems it solves:**\n\n- **Data quality friction** – Eliminates manual data cleaning and normalization between lead sources and your CRM\n- **Integration complexity** – Single unified API to extract leads from multiple data formats (text, images, emails) without provider lock-in\n- **Validation overhead** – Built-in constraint validation (email format, phone patterns, required fields) prevents garbage data from polluting your database\n- **Scaling extraction logic** – Batch inference API handles high-volume lead processing asynchronously—submit 1000s of prospects, retrieve results when ready\n- **Multi-provider flexibility** – Develop with cheaper models (Ollama, Groq), deploy with reliable ones (OpenAI, Anthropic)—no code rewrites\n- **Missing context enrichment** – Batch embeddings and retrieval capabilities let you enrich leads with company knowledge bases or intent signals before scoring\n\nPerfect for automating lead qualification workflows, deduplication, and real-time form-to-CRM pipelines where data consistency directly impacts conversion rates."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":14,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5854,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5854,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":321,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}